  "statement": "Let \\[ \\begin{aligned} T={}&\\frac1{3-\\sqrt8} -\\frac1{\\sqrt8-\\sqrt7}\\\\ &+\\frac1{\\sqrt7-\\sqrt6} -\\frac1{\\sqrt6-\\sqrt5}\\\\ &+\\frac1{\\sqrt5-2}; \\end{aligned} \\] then",
