      "label": "E",
      "text": "\\(\\displaystyle\nT=\\frac1{\\substack{(3-\\sqrt8)(\\sqrt8-\\sqrt7)(\\sqrt7-\\sqrt6)\\\\\n{}\\cdot(\\sqrt6-\\sqrt5)(\\sqrt5-2)}}\\)"
