    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1974-p20.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Rationalizing the five terms gives \\[ \\begin{aligned} T={}&(3+\\sqrt8)-(\\sqrt8+\\sqrt7)\\\\ &+(\\sqrt7+\\sqrt6)-(\\sqrt6+\\sqrt5)\\\\ &+(\\sqrt5+2)=5. \\end{aligned} \\] Thus \\(T\\gt2.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is D.",
      "hints": [
        "Rationalize each denominator separately",
        "Every denominator is a difference of square roots whose squares differ by \\(1\\)"
